"Key = what it does. Keys: F1-F24, Up, Home, PageUp, Insert, Delete, Tab, "
"Enter, Escape, Space or a character, with Ctrl+ Alt+ Shift+ (characters need "
"Ctrl or Alt). Text is sent (\\r is Enter); or script: file, menu: command, "
"run: program, telnet: brk|ayt|ip|ao|ec|el|ga|nop."
msgstr "Klahv = mida see teeb. Klahvid: F1-F24, Up, Home, PageUp, Insert, Delete, Tab, Enter, Escape, Space või märk, koos Ctrl+ Alt+ Shift+ (märgid vajavad Ctrl-i või Alt-i). Saadetakse tekst (\\r on Enter); või script: fail, menu: käsk, run: programm, telnet: brk|ayt|ip|ao|ec|el|ga|nop."

