"Runs each time the session connects. A .rhai file runs as a Rhai script and "
"a .py file as a SecureCRT Python script (see the README). Otherwise one "
"command per line: wait <text> (for the host to print it), send <text> (\\r "
"is Enter), sleep <ms>, timeout <s> (for later waits; default 30), # comment."
msgstr "Käivitub iga kord, kui seanss ühendub. .rhai-fail käivitatakse Rhai skriptina ja .py-fail SecureCRT Pythoni skriptina (vt README). Muidu üks käsk rea kohta: wait <tekst> (oota, kuni host selle prindib), send <tekst> (\\r on Enter), sleep <ms>, timeout <s> (hilisemate ootuste jaoks; vaikimisi 30), # kommentaar."

